---
title: "Stage 4: measuring one row in build_and_measure (HF, llama.cpp, vLLM, TensorRT-LLM)"
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant BM as build_and_measure
    participant HF as eval.metrics
    participant DS as eval.downstream
    participant LC as eval.llamacpp
    participant EX as eval.gptq_export
    participant VB as eval.vllm_backend
    participant VW as vllm_worker (vLLM Python)
    participant TB as eval.trtllm_backend
    participant TW as trtllm_worker (TensorRT-LLM Python)

    BM->>HF: measure_model(model, val, held, cfg.eval, device)
    Note over HF: perplexity on validation and held-out halves,<br/>size, peak memory, prefill and decode latency<br/>(warmup + repeats, mean and std)
    HF-->>BM: metrics, raw
    opt eval.downstream_tasks set
        BM->>DS: downstream_accuracy(model, tokenizer, tasks)
        DS-->>BM: accuracy per task + mean (lm-eval)
    end
    BM->>BM: zero_weight_share(model) (weight rows)
    opt Stage 1 weight row and eval.llamacpp_dir set
        BM->>LC: measure(model, tokenizer, plan, val, held)
        LC->>LC: save_pretrained, convert_hf_to_gguf (F16)
        LC->>LC: llama-quantize --pure, per-layer --tensor-type from the plan
        LC->>LC: llama-bench (speed), llama-perplexity (val, held-out)
        LC-->>BM: llamacpp_size_gb, speed, llamacpp_ppl_*
    end
    opt Stage 1 weight row and eval.vllm_python set
        BM->>VB: measure(...)
        VB->>EX: export(model, plan): mixed-bit GPTQ checkpoint
        VB->>VW: subprocess with args.json
        VW-->>VB: last stdout line: JSON metrics
        alt worker failed
            VB-->>BM: raises VLLMError (row keeps vllm_error)
        else
            VB-->>BM: vllm_size_gb, vllm_decode_ms_per_token, vllm_ppl_*
        end
    end
    opt Stage 1 weight row and eval.trtllm_python set
        BM->>TB: measure(...)
        TB->>EX: export + hf_quant_config.json
        TB->>TW: subprocess: build engine, measure
        alt worker failed
            TB-->>BM: raises TRTLLMError (row keeps trtllm_error)
        else
            TB-->>BM: trtllm_engine_gb, trtllm_decode_ms_per_token, trtllm_ppl_*
        end
    end
    BM->>BM: add build_time_s. Simulated methods in Stages 1-2 drop model_size_gb<br/>(the plan's predicted size is the size)
